{"pageid":1648,"title":"Magma Caves","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Magma Caves</span>","revid":22162,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Magma Caves</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/Lava_Cave_400x800.png/revision/latest?cb=20240315202302\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Lava Cave 400x800\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/Lava_Cave_400x800.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240315202302\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/Lava_Cave_400x800.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240315202302 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/Lava_Cave_400x800.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20240315202302 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Lava Cave 400x800\" width=\"270\" height=\"135\" data-image-key=\"Lava_Cave_400x800.png\" data-image-name=\"Lava Cave 400x800.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay, Mike's Mines</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Magma Trees, Burning Skull Quest, Flameslate, Burning Blossom(Petalfall quest)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Music\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Music</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wuRhh8yMX6k\">Kevin MacLeod - The Escalation</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Magma Caves</b> are a subarea of <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>, locked behind a rock wall that can be broken with explosives. Players can use three <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Bomb\" title=\"Small Bomb\">Small Bombs</a> from Mike Miner's shop to gain access into this area. The Magma Caves are characterized by dark rock pillars, lava pools, and red patches of dirt. \n</p><p>Note that having a <a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Coil\" title=\"Healing Coil\">Healing Coil</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a>, an <a href=\"/wiki/Obsidian_Skull\" title=\"Obsidian Skull\">Obsidian Skull</a>, or a <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a> is strongly recommended, as you <i>will</i> take damage when passing over lava pools. (driving skills are also required) \n</p><p>To get to the Magma Caves, go to Mike's Mines and try to follow the directions on the map next to the wall.   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Lumberwork\">Lumberwork</span></h2>\n<p>At the deepest point of Magma Caves, players can find the spawn point for <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Tree\" title=\"Magma Tree\">Magma Trees</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Blossom\" title=\"Burning Blossom\">Burning Blossoms</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ash_Tree\" title=\"Ash Tree\">Ash Trees</a>. Many of the sections in the Magma Caves require parkour, so it is difficult/near impossible for the player to bring their car to this point. It is recommended that players walk on foot to reach this area. While not necessary, a <a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</a> and a <a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Coil\" title=\"Speed Coil\">Speed Coil</a> (bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a>) can prove helpful when traversing the Magma Caves.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Magma Trees are an especially profitable tree that can also spawn from meteorites. However, note that the Magma Caves are difficult to farm due to the sheer distance away from player spawn, so farming Magma Trees from this location is not as expedient as farming <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushrooms</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>When sanded, Magma Tree wood displays a neon orange color that is useful in making lava and futuristic builds. Ash Trees offer a deep black coloration that can be used for framing other colors.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mining\">Mining</span></h2>\n<p>Upon areas with red dirt/grass, two types of rock nodes can spawn: <a href=\"/wiki/Lavaslate\" title=\"Lavaslate\">Lavaslate</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Blackstone\" title=\"Blackstone\">Blackstone</a>. On small islands in the lava lakes near the bottom of the caves, <a href=\"/wiki/Flameslate\" title=\"Flameslate\">Flameslate</a> nodes can also spawn. While not completely unique to this area, the rare ores for Magma Caves are:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adurite\" title=\"Adurite\">Adurite</a>, in Lavaslate nodes (but can spawn in other stone types).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Palladium\" title=\"Palladium\">Palladium</a>, in Blackstone nodes (but can spawn in other stone types).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Obsidian\" title=\"Obsidian\">Obsidian</a>, in Lavaslate and Blackstone nodes (but can also be found in Flameslate after Magmite freezes).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rosa_Flama_Quartz\" title=\"Rosa Flama Quartz\">Rosa Flame Quartz</a>, in Lavaslate nodes (but can spawn in other stone types).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magmite\" title=\"Magmite\">Magmite</a>, in Flameslate nodes only.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 139px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/64/Magma_Cave_without_Flashlight.png/revision/latest?cb=20230826013432\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Without a flashlight, ores are difficult to see.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/64/Magma_Cave_without_Flashlight.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/139?cb=20230826013432\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"139\" height=\"160\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Magma Cave without Flashlight.png\" data-image-key=\"Magma_Cave_without_Flashlight.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Magma_Cave_without_Flashlight.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Without a flashlight, ores are difficult to see.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 138px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/64/Magma_Cave_with_Flashlight.png/revision/latest?cb=20230826013252\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"With a flashlight, this ore is visible.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"138\" height=\"157\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Magma Cave with Flashlight.png\" data-image-key=\"Magma_Cave_with_Flashlight.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/64/Magma_Cave_with_Flashlight.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/138?cb=20230826013252\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/64/Magma_Cave_with_Flashlight.png/revision/latest?cb=20230826013252\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"With a flashlight, this ore is visible.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/64/Magma_Cave_with_Flashlight.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/138?cb=20230826013252\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"138\" height=\"157\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Magma Cave with Flashlight.png\" data-image-key=\"Magma_Cave_with_Flashlight.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/64/Magma_Cave_with_Flashlight.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/138?cb=20230826013252\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Magma_Cave_with_Flashlight.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">With a flashlight, this ore is visible.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>Note that Blackstone nodes have a dark coloration, making it difficult to see if any ores spawned in them. Moreover, the Magma Caves are dark, with a deeper black fog compared to Mike's Mines. A <a href=\"/wiki/Flashlight\" title=\"Flashlight\">Flashlight</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a> is very useful in identifying any ores in the nodes.\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special_Quests\">Special Quests</span></h2>\n<p>As part of the <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane Axe</a> quest, players can obtain the <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">Burning Skull</a> in this area. By placing a <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">Skull</a> next to a Magma Tree or lava pool, it will gradually redden and turn into a Burning Skull, used to unlock the Emberbane Axe.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other\">Other</span></h3>\n<p>On the right side of Magma Caves there is another cave that leads to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Void\" title=\"The Void\">The Void</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"532335d20d988cfe3fcdd5ef5a4319a9\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:124px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Magma_Cave_Entrance_Updated-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:122px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Magma_Cave_Entrance_Updated.png\" title=\"Magma Cave Entrance Updated.png (182 KB)\" style=\"height:122px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d9/Magma_Cav